      "releaseNotes": "What's New in bitchat 1.8.0:\n- Busy location channels are fast again. The people list opens instantly even with hundreds of people nearby, and the chat no longer jumps back while you scroll through a fast conversation.\n- Your drafts are kept when you switch between mesh, location channels and private chats.\n- Join a nearby location channel with one tap, and share channel invites from the share sheet.\n- Give someone a local alias on their fingerprint screen. Verified contacts now show a seal in private chats.\n- A recent chats section keeps every private conversation within reach.\n- A banner tells you when Bluetooth is off or Tor is stalled.\n- Panic wipe now asks for confirmation and tells you when it's done.\n- On Mac, scan verification QR codes with the camera. @-mention suggestions now work from the keyboard.\n- Messages from someone who shares your name are no longer treated as your own.\n- Security hardening and fixes throughout, and the app is now fully localized in all 30 supported languages.",
